  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Implementation Plans**\n\nI\'m now focusing on integrating both plan options. Implementing Plan 1, the Web Share Target API with PWA support, to link with the smartphone\'s share sheet, will be the initial phase. It\'s about setting up the foundation for smooth sharing functionality across platforms. I\'ll then move on to Plan 2, allowing AI-powered registration directly from shared URLs or text within the app.\n\n\n**Refining Web Manifest Integration**\n\nI\'ve been working on the technical specifics. I\'m placing the `manifest.json` file in `public/manifest.json` for proper PWA integration, including the share_target configuration with action \"/\", GET method, and parameters for title, text, and URL. Also, in `index.html`, I\'ve added the `<link rel=\"manifest\">` tag and necessary meta tags for mobile support.\n\n\n"
