    thinking: "**Brainstorming Positive Solutions**\n\nI\'m currently focused on turning negatives into positives, and zeros into pluses. I\'ve begun brainstorming ideas like a personalized \"My Page\" feature, enhanced risk management protocols, and improvements to UI/UX to make things easier. I\'m exploring how these concepts can be creatively applied to optimize this process.\n\n\n**Categorizing Proposed Improvements**\n\nI\'ve been organizing my thoughts into distinct categories: \"Turning Minuses to Zero\" focuses on risk mitigation and data security, addressing potential pain points, while \"Turning Zeros to Pluses\" concentrates on enhancing user experience, with a focus on UI/UX improvements and personalized features. I\'m actively refining the sub-categories under each, such as data backup, link validation, sharing, offline functionality, and My Page elements.\n\n\n"
