  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining New Features**\n\nI\'m currently focused on defining new features, specifically around data model extensions. I\'ve been working on adding new fields to the `RestaurantSpot` type in `src/types.ts`. I\'m including a `privateMemo` for personal notes and a `shareComment` for shared ones.\n\n\n**Expanding Data Model**\n\nI\'ve added several new fields to the RestaurantSpot type. Specifically, I\'ve incorporated `isPrivateOnly`, `folders`, `operatingStatus`, `statusCheckNote`, and `lastStatusCheckedAt`. Additionally, I\'ve defined a `CustomFolder` type with fields for ID, name, color, icon, and creation timestamp. Lastly, I\'m working on a backup format, `BackupData`.\n\nI\'m also working on a new API route `/api/spots/check-status` in `server.ts` that will use Gemini to check the operating status of restaurant spots.\n\n\n**Developing New Features**\n\nI\'m now focused on building components. I\'m actively working on `MyPageModal.tsx`, implementing the tabs for statistics, folder management, backup/restore, and privacy settings. Each tab has its own functionalities. I\'m also refining `SpotDetailModal.tsx`, `AddEditSpotModal.tsx`, `SpotCard.tsx` and `SpotListItem.tsx` to handle folder interactions.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
