  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining User Preferences**\n\nI\'m working on clarifying the requirements: I need to add a widget to the swipe screen. This widget needs to visualize \"recommended genres/areas\". This visualization is based on analyzing user preferences, derived from swipe results on the \"discover\" tab.\n\n\n**Visualizing Preferences Progress**\n\nI\'m now focused on designing a real-time \"preference insight\" widget for the swipe screen. I envision a compact, stylish display, maybe above or below the main deck. It will visualize preferences like recommended genres, areas, and usage scenarios, dynamically updated with each swipe. The widget will include swipe count, learning level, accuracy progress, and top genre/area scores, all animated to give the user a sense of AI understanding. It will also be collapsible.\n\n\n**Refining Card Interactions**\n\nI\'m now diving into the specifics of card movement and visual feedback. I\'m implementing dynamic rotation based on the horizontal drag amount, smoothly transitioning between -24 and +24 degrees. I\'m also adding a subtle scale-up and lift-up effect for vertical swipes. Furthermore, I\'m designing dynamic color changes tied to swipe direction; emerald green and a glow for right swipes, rose and a glow for left swipes, and amber/gold for up swipes.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 5
      nanos: 922493517
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
