  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining MyPageModal.tsx**\n\nOkay, I\'m deep diving into `MyPageModal.tsx` now. My goal is to completely fix any layout issues or glitches in the My Stats section, and really refine the My Page experience overall. I\'m carefully analyzing the code and its impact, aiming for a polished result.\n\n\n**Analyzing Data Displays**\n\nI\'m focused on improving how data is presented within the My Stats section. I\'m ensuring `visitedRatio` is zero when there are no total spots. I\'m also ensuring the \"No Data\" message is rendered when the total count is zero, as are other edge cases. Adding percentage bars for comparisons of areas, genres and other statistics would significantly improve the visual clarity. I\'m also addressing layout issues within the stats grid, particularly the text rendering and responsive behavior of the stats cards. Finally, I\'m working to prevent wrapping and display issues with longer names in the area and genre top lists.\n\n\n**Enhancing Visualizations & Layout**\n\nI\'m working to enhance the visual display of data within the MyPageModal. Specifically, I\'m focusing on adding percentage bars to prevent layout issues. I\'m aiming for consistent, balanced layouts for the recommender rankings, resolving the uneven display for 3 or 5 recommenders. I\'ll use `generateRecommenderAvatar(person)` to include avatars and focus on an even display from 1 to 4th rankings. I\'m also adding budget range distributions with sleek bar visualizations and scene distributions with count-badge tags. I am also working to refresh the modal styling with `bg-white rounded-2xl w-full max-w-2xl shadow-2xl border border-stone-200` to be modern.\n\n\n"
