  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining the Core Concept**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the core concept. It\'s becoming clearer that the goal is an editorial, lifestyle discovery platform, much closer to Pinterest or Lemon8 than a cold database like Tabelog. I\'m focusing on that editorial experience of browsing and inspiration, friend connections.\n\n\n**Refining the User Experience**\n\nI\'m now deeply immersed in refining the user experience. The concept of serendipitous browsing is paramount, aiming to make app exploration delightful even without a specific search. I\'m focusing intently on the \"Discover\" view and list view functionality. I\'m working to create an aesthetic lifestyle lookbook with a seamless flow for saving and marking visited locations. I\'m also ensuring a practical, fast comparison through a clear and concise layout.\n\n\n**Detailing the Visual Design**\n\nI\'m now deep in the weeds on visual detail. I\'m imagining a clear layout for each spot, including its price, shop name, quote snippets, and action buttons. The spot detail modal is taking shape, with a visual hero, a quote section, and quick navigation. Also I\'m streamlining the visual identity with a refined, minimal, editorial look. My palette is now based on neutrals, with warm terracotta as an accent, and I\'m simplifying typography with clean fonts.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Speed and Style**\n\nI\'m now honing in on performance and aesthetics, aiming for a beautiful and lightning-fast experience. I\'m focusing on lazy loading and async decoding of images to prevent layout shifts. I\'m also implementing clean transitions and animations that won\'t strain the CPU. To achieve this, I\'m working to set a refined neutral canvas background with smooth antialiasing and optimized typography classes. The header is being designed with an ultra-clean, editorial navigation bar that has quick access to import URLs, favourites, roulette and my page. The spot card is planned to be an editorial card layout.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 3
      nanos: 512596250
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
