  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Design Needs**\n\nI\'m currently dissecting the design elements, starting with the visual hierarchy and aesthetic alignment, aiming for a refined, minimal, and editorial feel. The initial focus is on the color palette, specifically the background. I\'m considering a warm off-white or ivory, such as `#FAF9F6` or `#FBF8F2`, as a canvas.\n\n\n**Refining Palette Choices**\n\nI\'ve solidified the color scheme details: deep charcoal text, muted tones, and a signature burnt orange accent. I\'m moving away from gradients, opting for crisp, solid colors and clean borders. Also, I\'ve eliminated excessively rounded corners, preferring more standard architectural radiuses.\n\n\n**Developing Interaction Designs**\n\nI\'m now prioritizing the user experience, zeroing in on intuitive interactions. \"\350\241\214\343\201\215\343\201\237\343\201\204\" and \"\350\241\214\343\201\243\343\201\237\" toggles are being refined for a seamless feel. The highlight dish will feature an orange sparkle badge. I\'m also ensuring fast image loading with lazy loading, asynchronous decoding, and a subtle backdrop blur.\n\n\n**Constructing Spot Detail View**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into the SpotDetailModal. I\'m focusing on the photo hero\'s functionality and visual flow. I\'m incorporating a high-quality photo with a counter, floating action buttons, and a concise top summary to inform quickly. The \"\350\252\260\343\201\256\343\201\212\343\201\231\343\201\231\343\202\201\357\274\237\" recommender section will offer personal recommendations. I\'m also refining the action bar with \"\350\241\214\343\201\215\343\201\237\343\201\204\" and \"\350\241\214\343\201\243\343\201\237\" toggles, external link buttons, and adding note sections with private and public options.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 4
      nanos: 993182017
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
